1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Welcome to Xentiment by Crunch.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,667
This app lets you trade
social media sentiment.

3
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:06,267
Here's how it works.

4
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:08,867
Our AI scans social media,

5
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:11,133
analyzes historical sentiment

6
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,867
around the topics you care about,

7
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:14,100
and finds correlations

8
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,500
between that sentiment
and asset prices.

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,667
When a correlation exists,

10
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:20,467
we backtest a trading strategy

11
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:21,667
and show you the results.

12
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:23,533
Real P&L.

13
00:00:23,533 --> 00:00:25,633
Real trades.

14
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:27,000
You start with a thesis.

15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,333
Something like

16
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,700
"How bullish is Elon today?"

17
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,900
The app measures that sentiment

18
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,633
over time

19
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:34,100
and checks whether it's

20
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,167
historically predicted
Bitcoin price moves.

21
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:37,533
If it has,

22
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:38,700
you can trade on it.

23
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,200
Let's try it out.

24
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,167
I'll log in with my X account,

25
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:43,500
authorize the app,

26
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,967
verify my account,

27
00:00:44,967 --> 00:00:46,100
and I'm in.

28
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,567
Now I click Earn Rewards.

29
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:50,300
Here's the interface.

30
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,667
Right now,

31
00:00:51,667 --> 00:00:53,467
the tradable asset is Bitcoin

32
00:00:53,467 --> 00:00:55,300
and the data source is X —

33
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,367
top minds.

34
00:00:56,367 --> 00:00:58,400
More assets and data sources

35
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,267
are coming soon.

36
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,500
Let's ask:

37
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,967
"Is Elon bullish?"

38
00:01:01,967 --> 00:01:04,200
We're measuring how bullish

39
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,033
Elon's sentiment has been
over time

40
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:07,333
and whether that maps

41
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:08,233
to price movement.

42
00:01:08,233 --> 00:01:09,600
I'll hit submit.

43
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:12,200
The app is now scanning signals,

44
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,600
analyzing mentions,

45
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:15,533
and building out
the sentiment chart.

46
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:16,800
Here we go.

47
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:18,067
Three charts.

48
00:01:18,067 --> 00:01:19,467
First:

49
00:01:19,467 --> 00:01:20,733
the correlation between

50
00:01:20,733 --> 00:01:21,933
our question's sentiment

51
00:01:21,933 --> 00:01:23,533
and Bitcoin price moves.

52
00:01:23,533 --> 00:01:25,900
We're seeing 10.9%,

53
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,733
which is actually
quite significant.

54
00:01:27,733 --> 00:01:30,200
Second: the P&L.

55
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,867
Trading this strategy

56
00:01:31,867 --> 00:01:33,300
with the paper trading capital

57
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:34,100
in my account

58
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:37,133
would have produced
$30,000 in profit.

59
00:01:37,133 --> 00:01:39,967
Every user gets
paper trading capital

60
00:01:39,967 --> 00:01:41,067
to test strategies

61
00:01:41,067 --> 00:01:42,467
without risking real money.

62
00:01:42,467 --> 00:01:45,133
Third: the actual trades.

63
00:01:45,133 --> 00:01:46,633
Every position —

64
00:01:46,633 --> 00:01:50,100
long, short, closed, reverse —

65
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:52,533
all driven by
the sentiment question

66
00:01:52,533 --> 00:01:53,133
you created.

67
00:01:53,133 --> 00:01:54,733
In this case,

68
00:01:54,733 --> 00:01:56,733
three out of three
winning trades.

69
00:01:56,733 --> 00:01:58,600
If you like the result,

70
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,967
click Paper Trade

71
00:01:59,967 --> 00:02:01,333
to take the strategy live.

72
00:02:01,333 --> 00:02:03,533
The algorithm now monitors

73
00:02:03,533 --> 00:02:04,833
conditions in real time,

74
00:02:04,833 --> 00:02:06,767
and when it finds
the right edge,

75
00:02:06,767 --> 00:02:08,700
trades execute automatically.

76
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:10,833
Since we just activated,

77
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:12,300
there are no trades yet —

78
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:14,100
but once conditions align,

79
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:14,967
it will start.

80
00:02:14,967 --> 00:02:17,267
You can check back
on this strategy

81
00:02:17,267 --> 00:02:18,000
at any time.

82
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,433
You can grow your
paper trading capital

83
00:02:20,433 --> 00:02:21,800
by sharing an invite link

84
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,000
to bring in new users,

85
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,167
or by sharing a trading card

86
00:02:25,167 --> 00:02:26,900
that shows your expected P&L.

87
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:28,800
Both boost your points

88
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,667
and your capital.

89
00:02:29,667 --> 00:02:32,000
Your dashboard shows everything:

90
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,767
ongoing strategies,

91
00:02:33,767 --> 00:02:34,967
trade monitoring,

92
00:02:34,967 --> 00:02:37,200
and the history of all
the questions

93
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:37,800
you've tested.

94
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,100
You can run multiple strategies

95
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:41,400
and compare performance.

96
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,233
There's also a leaderboard

97
00:02:43,233 --> 00:02:44,133
ranked by invites

98
00:02:44,133 --> 00:02:45,433
and strategy performance.

99
00:02:45,433 --> 00:02:47,733
You earn capital boosts —

100
00:02:47,733 --> 00:02:49,600
50K and 100K —

101
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:51,233
by testing strategies,

102
00:02:51,233 --> 00:02:52,633
sharing trading cards,

103
00:02:52,633 --> 00:02:53,700
and inviting users.

104
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,200
That's Xentiment.

105
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,767
Ask a question,

106
00:02:56,767 --> 00:02:58,000
find the correlation,

107
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,300
trade the sentiment.

